\title{idcheck: Validate Identity Numbers and Check Digits}
\description{
Tests whether strings are well-formed identity numbers, fast and vectorized over character vectors. The first release covers India: Aadhaar, Permanent Account Number, Goods and Services Tax Identification Number, voter identity card number, passport number and mobile number. The check-digit algorithms are exported on their own: Luhn, Verhoeff, Damm, and 'ISO/IEC 7064' MOD 11-2 and MOD 97-10. Malformed input returns FALSE rather than an error.
